    "title": "Budget-Friendly Family Activities in Bangkok (Under $10 per Person)",
    "excerpt": "Bangkok doesn't have to break the bank. From floating markets at $1 to temples under $3 — 15+ family activities in Bangkok that cost less than a fancy coffee. Real prices, transport tips, and how to keep kids happy on a budget.",
    "date": "May 18, 2026",
    "author": "Family Travel Asia Team",
    "tags": [
      "bangkok",
