    "slug": "best-airbnb-vs-hotels-for-families-in-asia",
    "title": "Airbnb vs Hotels for Families in Asia: The Real Parent's Guide",
    "excerpt": "Kitchen vs room service? Washing machine vs pool? We break down every factor — cost, space, convenience, safety, and sanity — so you know exactly which to book for your family trip to Asia.",
    "date": "May 16, 2026",
    "author": "Family Travel Asia",
    "tags": [
      "accommodation",
      "airbnb",
